different results from simply getting three times the market return. It is a normal regulated ETF traded on an exchange.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"R3_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID36","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID37","SecondaryAttribute":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","DataExportTag":"R3_LEGIT","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"0 = Clearly illegitimate \/ fraudulent"},"2":{"Display":"100 = Clearly legitimate"}},"QuestionID":"QID37"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID38","SecondaryAttribute":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is ex","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is exactly a