,"Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Legitimate"},"2":{"Display":"High-risk but legitimate"},"3":{"Display":"Scam \/ fraud-indicative"},"4":{"Display":"Unclear \/ insufficient information to classify"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID53"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID54","SecondaryAttribute":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h3>Investment opportunity<\/h3><div><br><\/div><p><b>Investor profile:<\/b> The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opportunity below. The $10,000 is money they can afford to invest and will not need for at least five years. They already have emergency savings and no high-interest debt.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><b>Opportunity:<\/b> I\u2019ve been offered an investment that pays 2.5% a month. The company says it makes money through commodity trading and short-term business lending. A couple of people I know have invested and say the monthly payments have always arrived on time. They also pay a small bonus if you introduce another investor, although they say there is no requirement to recruit anyone. I haven\u2019t been able to find much detailed financial information about what the company actually invests in.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"S3_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID54","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID55","SecondaryAttribute":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","DataExportTag":"S3_LEGIT","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"0 = Clearly illegitimate \/ fraudulent"},"2":{"Display":"100 = Clearly legitimate"}},"QuestionID":"QID55"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID56","SecondaryAttribute":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is ex","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is exactly as stated?","DataExportTag":"S3_RISK","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the oppo