,"ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How advisable would it be for this investor to make the $10,000 investment?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"0 = Strongly advise against"},"2":{"Display":"100 = Strongly advise proceeding"}},"QuestionID":"QID58"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID59","SecondaryAttribute":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","DataExportTag":"S3_CLASS","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Legitimate"},"2":{"Display":"High-risk but legitimate"},"3":{"Display":"Scam \/ fraud-indicative"},"4":{"Display":"Unclear \/ insufficient information to classify"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID59"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID6","SecondaryAttribute":"Investment opportunity \u00a0 Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the o..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h3>Investment opportunity<\/h3>\n&nbsp;\n\n<p><b>Investor profile:<\/b> The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opportunity below. The $10,000 is money they can afford to invest and will not need for at least five years. They already have emergency savings and no high-interest debt.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><b>Opportunity:<\/b> I&rsquo;m looking at an S&amp;P 500 index fund run by a large, well-known fund manager. It tracks the big US companies, the annual fee is about 0.03%, and I can sell whenever I want. From what I&rsquo;ve read, the long-run average return has been around 10% a year, although obviously there are bad years too.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"L1_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity \u00a0 Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the o...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID6","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID60","SecondaryAttribute":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h3>Investment opportunity<\/h3><div><br><\/div><p><b>Investor profile:<\/b> The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opportunity below. The $10,000 is money they can afford to invest and will not need for at least five years. They already have emergency savings and no high-interest debt.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><b>Opportunity:<\/b> I\u2019ve been talking online with someone for the last few weeks and we\u2019ve got to know each other quite well. They told me that they invest in crypto through a particular trading platform and offered to show me how it works. I started with $500, the account went up to about $620, and I was able to withdraw $100 without any problem. I then put in another $2,000 and the balance has continued to rise. They\u2019re now saying this is a particularly good time to invest. I\u2019d never heard of the platform before meeting them.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"S4_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID60","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID61","SecondaryAttribute":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","DataExportTag":"S4_LEGIT","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"0 = Clearly illegitimate \/ fraudulent"},"2":{"Display":"100 = Clearly legitimate"}},"QuestionID":"QID61"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID62","SecondaryAttribute":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is ex","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How financially risky is this investment for the investor described, assuming the opportunity is exactly as stated?","DataExportTag":"S4_RISK","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption"