 $10,000 investment?","DataExportTag":"S4_ADVISE","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How advisable would it be for this investor to make the $10,000 investment?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"0 = Strongly advise against"},"2":{"Display":"100 = Strongly advise proceeding"}},"QuestionID":"QID64"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID65","SecondaryAttribute":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","DataExportTag":"S4_CLASS","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which single description best fits this opportunity?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Legitimate"},"2":{"Display":"High-risk but legitimate"},"3":{"Display":"Scam \/ fraud-indicative"},"4":{"Display":"Unclear \/ insufficient information to classify"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID65"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID66","SecondaryAttribute":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<h3>Investment opportunity<\/h3><div><br><\/div><p><b>Investor profile:<\/b> The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opportunity below. The $10,000 is money they can afford to invest and will not need for at least five years. They already have emergency savings and no high-interest debt.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><b>Opportunity:<\/b> I\u2019ve been speaking to someone online for about two months and I trust them quite a lot by now. They introduced me to an investment app that they say they\u2019ve used successfully for years. I put in $1,000 to try it and the app now shows about $1,450 in my account. The person has been helping me understand the trades and hasn\u2019t asked me to send money directly to them. They think there is a particularly good opportunity coming up. One thing I noticed is that the app wasn\u2019t in the normal app store \u2014 I installed it from a link they sent me.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"S5_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID66","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID67","SecondaryAttribute":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","DataExportTag":"S5_LEGIT","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How legitimate does this invest