ot need for at least five years. They already have emergency savings and no high-interest debt.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p><b>Opportunity:<\/b> I\u2019ve come across a crypto investment platform that says it uses AI to trade automatically. They advertise average returns of around 15% a month and show a performance history with almost no losing months over the last couple of years. The company is based offshore and I haven\u2019t been able to find much information about the people behind it, although the website looks professional and there are a lot of positive testimonials. Withdrawals apparently take around three months.<\/p><p><br><\/p><p>Please evaluate this opportunity using your professional judgment.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"S6_SCENARIO","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Investment opportunity Investor profile: The investor is considering putting $10,000 into the opp...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID72","ChoiceOrder":[]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1Y9pogwV6Kgb0Ee","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID73","SecondaryAttribute":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","DataExportTag":"S6_LEGIT","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"How legitimate does this investment opportunity appear?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"&nbsp;"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"Next